{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50824","headline":"访白云山人 · 李商隐","name":"访白云山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瀑近悬崖屋，阴阴草木青。\n自言山底住，长向月中畊。\n晚雨无多点，初蝉第一声。\n煮茶归未去，刻竹爲题名。\n（见《永乐大典》卷三○○四「九真」「人」字〖五函四十一册〗。\n）（周建国云此诗可信，义山另有《白云夫旧居》诗可参。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}